.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "skillastic docs" 1  "skillastic docs " 
.SH NAME
skillastic docs \- Generate or render human\-facing docs pages for skills
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskillastic docs\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate or render human\-facing docs pages for skills
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
skillastic docs\-generate(1)
Generate a docs page for a skill
.TP
skillastic docs\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
